WEBVTT

00:18:57.564 --> 00:19:00.051
in designer clothes and large sunglasses.

00:19:00.075 --> 00:19:03.199
She's been featured in magazines
like "Cosmo" and "In Style."

00:19:03.223 --> 00:19:05.794
And she's walked the runway
at New York Fashion Week.

00:19:05.818 --> 00:19:07.970
Actually, she's walked
more than one runway.

00:19:07.994 --> 00:19:11.595
LS: I have no background
in the fashion industry,

00:19:11.619 --> 00:19:17.116
but I was in the runway show
last spring with Kate Spade.

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:19.671
I've worked with them quite a bit.

00:19:19.695 --> 00:19:21.108
AG: Some people will tell you

00:19:21.132 --> 00:19:23.576
that most of us do our best work
when we're younger,

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.378
that when we approach retirement age,

00:19:25.402 --> 00:19:27.330
we should slow down, take up a hobby,

00:19:27.354 --> 00:19:28.990
play with the grandkids.

00:19:29.385 --> 00:19:32.221
But excellence later
in your career is possible,